#: ../../index.rst:1
msgid "Guidedog Manual"
msgstr "Guidedog 手册"

#: ../../index.rst:4
msgid "**Write once. Explain well. Publish on the web and on paper.**"
msgstr "**写一份源码，讲清楚道理，同时发布到网页与纸上。**"

#: ../../index.rst:6
msgid "Guidedog is a documentation generator. It builds HTML websites and PDF books from reStructuredText and Markdown sources. It is one self-contained program, written in Rust. It needs no Python environment and no LaTeX installation. The conversion engine is called **Guidedoc**. The embedded Typst compiler typesets the PDF pages, and Guidedog writes the website directly."
msgstr "Guidedog 是一个文档生成器，它把 reStructuredText 和 Markdown 源文件构建成 HTML 网站和 PDF 书籍。它是用 Rust 编写的单个独立程序，不需要 Python 环境，也不需要安装 LaTeX。转换引擎名为 **Guidedoc**。PDF 页面由内嵌的 Typst 编译器排版，网站由 Guidedog 直接生成。"

#: ../../index.rst:12
msgid ""
"A small project needs three things: a source document, a table of "
"contents, and ``conf.toml``. Start with :doc:`tutorial/first-project`. "
"For a particular task, use :doc:`howto/index`. For an exact contract, use "
":doc:`reference/index`."
msgstr ""
"小型项目只需三样东西：源文档、目录和 ``conf.toml``\\ 。从 :doc:`tutorial/first-project` "
"开始。具体任务查阅 :doc:`howto/index`\\ ，准确约定查阅 :doc:`reference/index`\\ 。"

#: ../../index.rst:19
msgid ""
"RST and Markdown enter Guidedoc; HTML goes to a browser and Typst "
"produces PDF."
msgstr "RST 和 Markdown 进入 Guidedoc；HTML 送到浏览器，Typst 生成 PDF。"

#: ../../index.rst:19
msgid "One source project, two publications."
msgstr "一套源文件，两种出版形式。"

